


<div id="main-content" class="check" role="main">

    <div class="container">
      <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-12 pb-3">
          <h1 class="text-dark fs-4  pb-sm-3">Kit의 Setting을 확인 하세요</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="btn-group btn-group-lg col-12 col-lg-7 mx-auto my-3">
          <button type="button" id="btn_reboot" class="btn btn-primary text-white mx-auto" title="Kit 재부팅하기">Kit 재부팅</button>
          <button type="button" id="btn_shutdown" class="btn btn-dark mx-auto" title="Kit 종료하기">Kit 종료</button>
        </div>
        <article class="col-12 mx-auto my-5">
          <div class="accordion shadow-sm" id="accordionPanels">
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header" id="panelsStayOpen-heading0">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#panelsStayOpen-collapse0" aria-expanded="true"
                  aria-controls="panelsStayOpen-collapse0">
                  OS 확인
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="panelsStayOpen-collapse0" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                aria-labelledby="panelsStayOpen-heading0">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <div class="col-12 col-lg-7 mx-auto p-4">
                    <div class="text-center">
                      <i class="bi bi-exclamation-circle d-inline-block pe-1 text-warning "></i>
                      <span class="text-muted">Kit OS를 선택하세요</span>
                      <select name="selKitOs" class="form-select" style="margin: 10px 0">
                        <option>Raspberry</option>
                        <option>Orange</option>
                      </select>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="d-grid col-12 col-lg-7 mx-auto my-3">
                    <div class="btn-group">
                      <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary text-white" id="btnSelectOs"
                        title="">선택한 OS 설정 저장하기</button>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header" id="panelsStayOpen-heading1">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#panelsStayOpen-collapse1" aria-expanded="true"
                  aria-controls="panelsStayOpen-collapse1">
                  hostapd 변경
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="panelsStayOpen-collapse1" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                aria-labelledby="panelsStayOpen-heading1">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <div class="col-12 col-lg-7 mx-auto p-4">
                    <div class="text-center">
                      <i class="bi bi-exclamation-circle d-inline-block pe-1 text-warning "></i>
                      <span class="text-muted">연결하는 Kit의 hostapd 명칭을 변경합니다.</span>
                      <input type="text" name="inHostapd" class="form-control" style="margin: 10px 0" />
                    </div>
                    
                  </div>
                  <div class="d-grid col-12 col-lg-7 mx-auto my-3">
                    <div class="btn-group">
                      <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary text-white" id="btnHostapd"
                        title="">hostapd 설정 저장하기</button>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header" id="panelsStayOpen-heading2">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#panelsStayOpen-collapse2" aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="panelsStayOpen-collapse2">
                  패스워드 변경
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="panelsStayOpen-collapse2" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                aria-labelledby="panelsStayOpen-heading2">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <div class="col-12 col-lg-7 mx-auto p-4">
                    <div class="text-center">
                      <i class="bi bi-exclamation-circle d-inline-block pe-1 text-warning "></i>
                      <span class="text-muted">연결하는 Kit의 패스워드를 변경합니다.</span>
                      <input type="password" name="inPwd" class="form-control" style="margin: 10px 0" />
                    </div>
                    
                  </div>
                  <div class="d-grid col-12 col-lg-7 mx-auto my-3">
                    <div class="btn-group">
                      <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary text-white" id="btnPassword"
                        title="">패스워드 설정 저장하기</button>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header" id="panelsStayOpen-heading3">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#panelsStayOpen-collapse3" aria-expanded="true"
                  aria-controls="panelsStayOpen-collapse3">
                  카메라 확인
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="panelsStayOpen-collapse3" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                aria-labelledby="panelsStayOpen-heading3">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <div class="col-12 col-lg-7 mx-auto p-4">
                    <div class="text-center">
                      <i class="bi bi-exclamation-circle d-inline-block pe-1 text-warning "></i>
                      <span class="text-muted">카메라확인 후 영상보기 버튼을 클릭하세요</span>
                    </div>
                    <!-- <pre>카메라가 정상적으로 연결되었습니다.</pre>
                    <div id="video" >
                      <img class="w-100" src="./static/images/camera_check_320x240.png" alt="Connecting to Live Video" >
                    </div>
                    <pre id="notice" class="pt-2">화면이 흐리면 렌즈를 좌우로 조금씩 돌리면서 맞춰주세요.</br>시계방향으로 끝까지 돌리면 카메라센서가 고장날 수 있으니 조심하세요.</pre> -->
                  </div>
                  <div class="d-grid col-12 col-lg-7 mx-auto my-3">
                    <div class="btn-group">
                      <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary text-white" id="runId"
                        title="카메라 영상 보기">영상보기</button>
                      <button type="button" class="btn btn-dark-primary" id="recordId" title="카메라 영상 끄기">영상끄기</button>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header" id="panelsStayOpen-heading4">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#panelsStayOpen-collapse4" aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="panelsStayOpen-collapse4">
                  모터 확인
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="panelsStayOpen-collapse4" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                aria-labelledby="panelsStayOpen-heading4">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <pre>좌측바퀴와 우측바퀴가 각각 3초간 앞으로 동작합니다.
만약 바퀴가 다른 방식으로 동작하면 모터 연결 전선을 확인해서 변경해 주세요.</pre>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>



    </section>

  </div>